                  <description>CMP2 value is set by hardware as soon as a capture 1 event occurs. It is loaded with the (capture1 divided by 2) value. The initial value can be written by the user (as long as TRGHLF is</description>
                  <value>0x1</value>
                </enumeratedValue>
              </enumeratedValues>
